sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant C as Client
    participant A as Auth server
    participant R as Resource API
    U->>C: Sign in
    C->>A: Authorization request
    A-->>U: Consent screen
    U->>A: Approve
    A-->>C: Authorization code
    C->>A: Exchange code
    A-->>C: Access token
    C->>R: Request with token
    R-->>C: Protected resource
    C-->>U: Show data
